Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.43,0:00:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.97,0:00:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.57,0:00:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Your moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.07,0:01:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,This is one lightning storm I don't\Nthink my swordsman's gonna weather
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.15,0:01:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,If you got any bright\Nideas, now's the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.73,0:01:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Gate Guardian, Thunderstroke attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.77,0:01:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, can't look!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.35,0:01:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, now you see Our Gate Guardian\Nconquers all Not this turn Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.51,0:01:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless he's not infected by traps.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.01,0:01:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Mirror Force, reflect his attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.87,0:01:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.29,0:01:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Gate Guardian defend!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.27,0:01:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Squall Barricade!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.15,0:01:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Our monster's not felled!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.33,0:01:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.59,0:01:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,repelled!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.50,0:01:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but your Guardian has deflected\Nmy attack right at your monster tamer!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.95,0:02:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You've destroyed your own monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.85,0:02:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucky move.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.45,0:02:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to play, fellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.07,0:02:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it up and we'll be out of\Nthese musty old caves in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.61,0:02:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.53,0:02:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it up, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.87,0:02:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We know you're in here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.41,0:02:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's no use hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.11,0:02:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, maybe he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.49,0:02:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't find any trace in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.33,0:02:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.24,0:02:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way he could have escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.85,0:02:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But, sir, I've checked every corridor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.85,0:02:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Then stand guard by his brother's cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.93,0:02:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll show up. Now go. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.17,0:02:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.45,0:02:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.79,0:02:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.07,0:02:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.23,0:02:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make your move just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.09,0:02:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.00,0:02:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at the Gate Guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.47,0:02:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It was created by combining\Nthree different monsters, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.73,0:02:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,So so that may be our\Nticket to dismantling.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.77,0:02:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,him right section by\Nsection okay then flame
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.03,0:03:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,swordsman use salamander's\Nmagic and attack
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.71,0:03:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,the midsection
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.62,0:03:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,attaboy
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.35,0:03:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,scorch him good huh
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.73,0:03:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,you fool attack one section and the\Nothers will defend it you wasted
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.97,0:03:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,your turn now my guardian will lay\Nwaste to you tidal surge attack
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.61,0:03:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,oh my dox is using the water\Nelemental section of his
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.85,0:03:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,gate guardian to flush out\Nthe entire maze everything
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.97,0:03:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,in its path will be attacked\Nthe mystic properties
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.59,0:03:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Of the Magic Hats will\Nprotect the Magician,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.17,0:03:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm afraid Joey's\Nswordsman won't be as lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.79,0:03:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, we have taken the lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.85,0:03:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,For now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.29,0:04:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Your gate guardian may have dampened\Nthe field, but not our spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.65,0:04:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,For my turn, I lay this card face down,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.03,0:04:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,and I call upon the summon skull to finish\Nthe job Joey's Flamed Swordsman started.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.55,0:04:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you must be joking!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.41,0:04:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That Swordsman started nothing\Nbefore he left choking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.13,0:04:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.04,0:04:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm, that's not quite true.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.13,0:04:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,If it weren't for him, the stage wouldn't\Nbe set for my Summon Skull's attack. Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.11,0:04:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The water!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.51,0:04:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Hee's gonna use it as a\Nconductor for an electrical attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.91,0:04:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Summon Skull!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.09,0:04:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Lightning strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.87,0:04:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The water's actually guiding the attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.57,0:04:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Payback time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.11,0:04:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.27,0:04:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You may have found a watery trail\Nleading back to our guardian,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.63,0:04:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,but you have yet to breach his defenses.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.05,0:04:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Defenses that we activate now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.01,0:04:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.11,0:05:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.37,0:05:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong is that by flooding the\Nwhole field with your tidal surge,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.91,0:05:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,you attacked my magical hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.07,0:05:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And hidden underneath one\Nof them was a trap. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.07,0:05:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,A trap that immobilizes your guardian and\Nleaves him powerless to defend himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.05,0:05:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.96,0:05:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,My gay guardian!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.39,0:05:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Ensnared by my spellbinding circle and\N700 defense points weaker because of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.75,0:05:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Leaving sewagen, your\Nguardian's water elemental,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.49,0:05:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,quite vulnerable to my electrical attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.87,0:05:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,One section down, two to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.27,0:05:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to go, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.55,0:05:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have this ugly luck\Nchopped down to size in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.67,0:05:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the way we do it, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.23,0:05:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look, all the water's disappearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.69,0:05:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only is Suogen gone, but it looks\Nlike he took all of his water with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.17,0:05:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Our Guardian is only damaged, not beaten.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.31,0:05:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Remove traps.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.15,0:05:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.06,0:05:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Even without Suogen, our\NGuardian is still unbeatable.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.37,0:06:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.65,0:06:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my turn now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.61,0:06:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Their Gate Guardian may be\Nunbeatable by any monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.45,0:06:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,but not by our teamwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.71,0:06:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, bozo brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.93,0:06:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to sound the size,\Nthe Red-Eyes Black Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.07,0:06:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, with the magic\Nof my polymerization card,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.87,0:06:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll combine Joey's Red-Eyes\Nwith my Summoned Skull.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.65,0:06:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,A combo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.95,0:06:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You now face...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.55,0:06:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The Supreme Black Skull Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.25,0:06:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Your guy ain't so unbeatable now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.77,0:06:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.87,0:06:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see your labyrinth stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.61,0:06:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.52,0:06:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you two clowns\Nlaughing about? You fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.67,0:07:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You think your new creature\Nwill win the match for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.61,0:07:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.85,0:07:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,There is little that your creature can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.37,0:07:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,For there is a maze rule\Nthat you must not have known.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.97,0:07:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,A rule?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.21,0:07:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.93,0:07:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.15,0:07:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And the rule states that the\Nlabyrinth is a no-flying zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.55,0:07:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.75,0:07:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And my red-eyes black dragon\Ncan only move by flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.33,0:07:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,These rules stink.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.49,0:07:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.40,0:07:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I have an alternate land.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.25,0:07:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I was hoping you'd say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.45,0:07:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.41,0:07:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We got a backup plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.47,0:07:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.05,0:07:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't they look worried?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.67,0:07:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So, uh, what do you think the\Nbald brothers are up to, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.43,0:07:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You mock us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.63,0:07:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But with this next card,\NI will trash your team.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.89,0:07:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Ryoku!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.55,0:07:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Ryoku?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.59,0:08:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all Greek to me, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.99,0:08:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Ryoku.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.35,0:08:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a rare and mighty card, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.25,0:08:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Too true.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.77,0:08:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Ryoku's legendary power allows\Nme to take half of my opponent's
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.57,0:08:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,life points and add them to one of\Nmy own creature's attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.29,0:08:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.20,0:08:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You might as well be stealing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.91,0:08:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay strong. Stay strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.11,0:08:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The only one on this field who will be\Nstaying strong is our gate guardian,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.81,0:08:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,for he is the one we are powering\Nup with your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.49,0:08:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That's like cutting their\Nchances to win in half.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.55,0:08:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Luckily for you, using the\NRyoku card ends our turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.87,0:08:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But when our next move is at hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.39,0:08:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,we will use our Gate Guardian's newfound\Npower to win this duel once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.73,0:08:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He will turn your monsters into\Nsmears on the Labyrinth Wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.21,0:08:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about them, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.03,0:08:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I still have a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.79,0:08:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.85,0:08:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Next step,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.03,0:09:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,my Dark Magician will leave the safety of\Nthe Magical Hats and return to the maze.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.39,0:09:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he'll move six spaces forward\Nand out of your labyrinth. You fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.49,0:09:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you moving your Dark\NMagician out of the maze when you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.57,0:09:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,know our Gate Guardian is right\Nthere just waiting to attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.45,0:09:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Does it matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.73,0:09:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem certain he'll win\Nregardless of what I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.05,0:09:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, yo, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.95,0:09:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Not for nothing, but do you\Nwant to fill me in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.73,0:09:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all right, Joey. Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.95,0:09:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, I play this card.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.85,0:09:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Reborn the monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.57,0:09:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter which of his monsters he revised\Nwith that card, it will do him no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.25,0:09:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Your plan will fail!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.77,0:09:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Gate Guardian, attack the Dark Magician!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.13,0:09:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You attacked without waiting to see which
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.71,0:09:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,monster I resurrected\Nfrom the graveyard pile,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.85,0:10:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,so you couldn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.25,0:10:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You wasted your attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.51,0:10:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Sui-jin, title, shield!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.23,0:10:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.15,0:10:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Recognize the monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.59,0:10:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You should, seeing as how it's yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.19,0:10:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,He used his reborn, the monster\Ncard, to bring back our Sui-jin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.01,0:10:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Only now he's not ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.45,0:10:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,He's been brought back on their side.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.49,0:10:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.93,0:10:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the play of the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.59,0:10:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.79,0:10:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure was.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.43,0:10:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the question is,\Ncan they follow through?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.13,0:10:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You have been lucky, you little louts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.45,0:10:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But we promise your\Nluck's about to run out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.73,0:10:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.64,0:10:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But in the meantime, it's Joey's turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.55,0:10:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.55,0:10:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi started our comeback.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.21,0:10:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I gotta keep it going.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.93,0:10:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That water elemental I revived bought\Nus some time, but not a whole lot of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.69,0:10:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's going to be up to Joey\Nto keep us in this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.43,0:11:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And I know he won't let us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.13,0:11:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm. Copycat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.11,0:11:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Copies one card your\Nopponent's thrown on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.65,0:11:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, I just got a killer idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.09,0:11:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Here it goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.41,0:11:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll use Copycat and play it as Ryoku.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.35,0:11:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.65,0:11:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Say adios to half of your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.21,0:11:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't worry, they're\Ngoing to a good cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.61,0:11:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,My Black Skull Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.59,0:11:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Great move, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.09,0:11:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Why power up your dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.07,0:11:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,He is still forbidden to fly in\Nthe maze and therefore cannot move.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.81,0:11:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,If you were smart,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.63,0:11:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,you wouldn't have used\Nit on that treacherous
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.23,0:11:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,water elemental because\Nit's him I'm attacking.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.11,0:11:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Thunderstroke, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.77,0:11:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Sujin, raise your shield! To defend!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.37,0:12:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,To be honest, we knew you would defend.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.05,0:12:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.01,0:12:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Now hit him again!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.45,0:12:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.61,0:12:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Suogen is only allowed to use his\NTidal Defense ability once per turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.49,0:12:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,So the Paradox Brothers split\Ntheir attack into two waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.47,0:12:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, did you really think that one\Nelemental could stand a chance against two?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.97,0:12:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That miscalculation\Nwill cost you the duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.43,0:12:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you're mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.45,0:12:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only did I know you could destroy\NSuogen, but I planned that you would.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.71,0:12:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.99,0:12:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything to draw attention\Naway from my Dark Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.53,0:12:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, if I'm to use this Monster\NReplace card with our Black Skull Dragon,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.93,0:12:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I needed someone strategically\Nplaced to switch places with.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.29,0:12:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,No, he can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.81,0:12:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,He played us for fooled, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.63,0:12:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Knowing that his dragon could\Nnot move within our labyrinth,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.39,0:12:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,he had his Dark Magician do it for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.77,0:13:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, Monster Replace!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.57,0:13:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Exchange the Dark Magician\Nwith the Black Skull Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.63,0:13:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,At first,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.73,0:13:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought the only way to beat your\Ngate garden was piece by piece But now,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.37,0:13:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,with our powered-up dragon,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.85,0:13:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,we can finish this with one final\Nferocious assault Black Skull Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.55,0:13:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Molten Fireball Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.61,0:13:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.71,0:13:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The duel goes to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.45,0:13:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,All right! They won!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.81,0:13:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't that mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.89,0:13:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. Ten stars. They see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.49,0:13:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,They did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.25,0:13:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.16,0:13:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And all set to duel Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.39,0:13:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Not quite set.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.95,0:13:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Still one test yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.71,0:13:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have known.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.67,0:14:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What was...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.13,0:14:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.05,0:14:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Sato?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.55,0:14:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Sato, it's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.63,0:14:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.47,0:14:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Sato!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.95,0:14:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I always knew that you would come and\Nrescue me. Always. Little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.39,0:14:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,So what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.77,0:14:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet you have some high-tech\Nplans to get me out of...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.95,0:14:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay still, kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.31,0:14:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, whatever you say, big brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.99,0:14:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give me one second to pick this lock.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.69,0:14:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, well, the brothers\NKaiba, reunited at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.97,0:14:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Bravo, Kaiba, bravo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.51,0:14:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew nothing would stop\Nyou from getting here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.11,0:14:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.57,0:14:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean there's another test?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.71,0:15:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi and I just beat you two in a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.63,0:15:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.87,0:15:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough to win our starships.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.69,0:15:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But not enough to escape this labyrinth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.23,0:15:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You still must choose a door, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.01,0:15:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.55,0:15:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, which of you brothers are guarding\Nthe door that leads out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.47,0:15:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,If you cherish your lives,\Nyou will choose my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.85,0:15:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Select my side or else you'll pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.11,0:15:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Not this game again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.03,0:15:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you two just act normal and\Ngive us a straight answer for once?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.25,0:15:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I am giving you a straight answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.35,0:15:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The answer is we can't\Ntrust either of these two.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.79,0:15:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.13,0:15:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Any bright ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.55,0:15:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, sure. Don't I always?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.51,0:15:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Zero respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.35,0:15:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll decide with these.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.01,0:15:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, heads or tails?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.05,0:15:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.96,0:15:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I marked each coin to\Nrepresent a different door.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.45,0:15:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The coin that I keep clenched in my fist\Nwill be the door that I have chosen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.87,0:15:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.93,0:15:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd come for Mokuba eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.77,0:16:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you did?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.05,0:16:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, tell me something, Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.73,0:16:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you also foresee what I'm about to\Ndo to you for harming my little brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.71,0:16:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, Kaiba, I predict\Nyou won't lay a finger on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.71,0:16:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.31,0:16:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.99,0:16:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,that coin is marked for\Ndox's door but was your
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.43,0:16:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,choice good or was it poor\Nwhat say you dox shall we
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.71,0:16:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,tell which was right in\Ndue time para i'm enjoying
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.11,0:16:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Their plight come on, was\Nit para or was it Doc's?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.19,0:16:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, fess up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.75,0:16:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I say...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.79,0:16:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You choose wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.85,0:16:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It was my doorway! All along!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.93,0:16:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,So Doc's door was the\Nright one? Not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.47,0:16:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.38,0:17:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes it was!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.59,0:17:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Except if we had picked it, Para's\Ndoor would be the right one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.31,0:17:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You can change which door\Nleads to which path, can't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.23,0:17:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ensuring that we choose wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.23,0:17:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.65,0:17:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys cheated.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.39,0:17:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad too late you chose\Na way, and that means...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.79,0:17:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,In this maze, you will stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.69,0:17:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, actually, you never saw our choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.99,0:17:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The Doc's coin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.29,0:17:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I figured the two of you\Nwould pull a stunt like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.43,0:17:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,so I pulled a stunt of my\Nown with these two coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.85,0:17:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead of marking them both\Nwith just one door insignia,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.77,0:17:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I marked the second coin with two.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.55,0:17:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,One insignia on each side.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.49,0:17:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That way, we couldn't lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.49,0:17:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Beat you at your own game.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.37,0:17:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Both of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.85,0:17:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, if you'll excuse us, we have\Na score to settle with your boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.53,0:17:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.11,0:17:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,On to Pegasus' castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.45,0:17:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You conniving snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.45,0:18:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I should take you down right now\Nfor what you've done to Moguba.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.69,0:18:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous, Kaiba boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.93,0:18:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,In my dungeon, in my castle, in my realm,\Nthe only one who makes threats is me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.73,0:18:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.01,0:18:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.33,0:18:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.37,0:18:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you done to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.59,0:18:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a little magic trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.59,0:18:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, what have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.25,0:18:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I've ensured your\Ncooperation, for you see...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.33,0:18:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba's soul is now imprisoned in a\Nplace where the locks can't be picked.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.11,0:18:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You're mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.13,0:18:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And there he will remain, Kaiba boy, until\Nyou beat me in a duel. Duel? With you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.31,0:18:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.22,0:18:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, I'll do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.63,0:18:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.54,0:18:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Not just yet, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.45,0:18:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You must first earn the\Nprivilege to challenge me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.77,0:18:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And you can only do that by\Ndefeating Yugi in a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.45,0:19:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you can't win against him,\NMokuba's soul will stay mine forever.
